Performance & Optimization
16. How do you optimize a slow Spring Batch job?
Solutions:

Increase chunk size (reduces transaction overhead).

Use partitioning (parallel processing).

Optimize SQL (indexes, batch inserts).

Disable unnecessary listeners.

17. What is the difference between JdbcCursorItemReader and JdbcPagingItemReader?
JdbcCursorItemReader: Uses a database cursor (faster but holds connection).

JdbcPagingItemReader: Uses pagination (slower but memory-safe).
